{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10136180","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10136180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1013618001:3":{"text":"샤키탈리스님! 왜 여기에 계시는 겁니까?","source_cn":"萨基塔里斯大人！您为什么在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E03C9D6B633429","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013618002:1":{"text":"내가 제때 도착한 것 같군. 아니면 방해한 건가?","source_cn":"我来得巧了。或者说，不太巧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DB8FBA5A7A5F7FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013618003:1":{"text":"이런, 하프를 챙겨오지 않았군. 지금이 딱 음악이 필요한 순간인데 말이야.","source_cn":"呵，真该带上我的竖琴的。此时此刻的情节，不觉得正适合伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CFB40CD276730D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013618004:2":{"text":"...으악, 무, 무슨 소리죠!","source_cn":"……唔啊！什、什么声音！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE181B2A84E24FE5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013618005:1":{"text":"누, 누가 치피의 잠을 깨운 거야!","source_cn":"是、是谁把满满吵醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44EDD23EF402D39A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013618006:2":{"text":"이 소리는... 어라, 아탈란테? 성석 마을에 있어야 할 당신이 왜 여기 있는 거죠?","source_cn":"发出声音的是——咦，阿塔兰忒？你、你不是被送回圣石镇了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A06B143E27F8E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013618007:1":{"text":"당연히 이 자리에 있어야지. 그녀는 이 희극의 중요한 주인공이니까.","source_cn":"当然要在场了。她可是这场人间喜剧重要的女主角。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0793206A2247B823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013618008:1":{"text":"에? 희극? 그게 대체... 아니, 샤키탈리스님?!","source_cn":"啊？喜剧？什么喜剧……说话的居然是萨基塔里斯阁下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10B538380C8B8CD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013618009:0":{"text":"그리고 나 역시 이 희극의 중요한 관객이니 말일세.","source_cn":"自然因为我也是这场喜剧重要的观众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88CC7286CBD19A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1013618009":{"text":"그리고 나 역시 이 희극의 중요한 관객이니 말일세.","source_cn":"自然因为我也是这场喜剧重要的观众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88CC7286CBD19A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1013618010:0":{"text":"희극이 항상 즐겁고 웃긴 것만은 아니지. 하지만 듀라 님께서 이 일을 비극이 되도록 놔두지 않으실 걸세.","source_cn":"喜剧并不一定全然是欢笑。但艾雅在上，总不会放任此事变成悲剧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48AFBDC998201C48","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"희극이 항상 즐겁고 웃긴 것만은 아니지. 하지만 듀라 님께서 이 일을 비극이 되도록 놔두지 않으실 걸세.","female":"희극이 항상 즐겁고 웃긴 것만은 아니지. 하지만 듀라 님께서 이 일을 비극이 되도록 놔두지 않으실 걸세.","variant_male_record_index":"115030","variant_female_record_index":"115031","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1013618012:1":{"text":"이제 하이라이트는 다 끝났군. 다음 씬에서 다시 날 불러주게나.","source_cn":"不过，精彩的一幕结束了。下一幕再呼唤我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A42CAA3ABD59F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"희극일까?","source_cn":"会是喜剧吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4613D2691F805FAA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"희극일까?","female":"희극일까?","variant_male_record_index":"62194","variant_female_record_index":"62195","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1013618011:1":{"text":"과장과 익살, 반전이 있지만, 결말은 나쁘지 않기 때문일세.","source_cn":"夸张、诙谐、转折，但结局总归不差。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x30C6E74E48E5BC2D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"과장과 익살, 반전이 있지만, 결말은 나쁘지 않기 때문일세.","female":"과장과 익살, 반전이 있지만, 결말은 나쁘지 않기 때문일세.","variant_male_record_index":"115032","variant_female_record_index":"115033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"왜 희극이지?","source_cn":"为什么是喜剧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BDC63D9160F4911","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"왜 희극이지?","female":"왜 희극이지?","variant_male_record_index":"62196","variant_female_record_index":"62197","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"샤키탈리스","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":4}}